"Bishoujo Battle: Double Strike!" includes the two games;

- Bishoujo Battle: Mahjong Solitaire - Let the military girls of "Rikku G Earth" be your companions as classic tile-matching gets more exhilarating than ever!

- Bishoujo Battle: Cyber Panic - Inspired by the naughty back-room arcades of '90s Japan, Bishoujo Battle Cyber Panic! Start each action-packed stage with a silhouetted girl behind the playfield and dodge enemies while drawing lines that cut away when connected, methodically uncovering the image underneath.

A complete re-release of the bullet hell game "DoDonPachi DaiOuJou" (Blissful Death), originally released at arcades in 2002!

Besides being an authentic port to the original experience, it also includes new visuals and sounds, and the late arcade version "Black Label".

Various functions that are common in the M2-Shot Triggers series are also installed in this work!
"Super Easy Mode", so you can enjoy the game with casual difficulty;
"Arcade Challenge Mode", that allows you to practice any stage repeatedly;
"M2 gadget", that displays various useful information on the borders of the screen;
And more!

In addition, it supports online ranking & replay downloads;
Quick save and quick load;
Vertical screen monitor display (TATE mode);
Settings that allow you to finely customize the game content, etc.

eFootball PES 2020 is a football simulation game developed and published by Konami. It is the 19th instalment in the Pro Evolution Soccer series and the first to include the "eFootball" branding, reflecting Konami's focus on esports.

The Legend Edition includes:

- 1 player available from 11 Legend players;
- Premium Agent (30 weeks);
- 3 player contracts renewals (30 weeks);
- Lionel Messi as a loan player (10 matches);
- Ronaldinho 3D scanned version from 2019.

The Elden Ring: Collector's Edition is a special game edition that includes the following physical and digital bonuses for fans and collectors:

- Physical copy of the game;
- SteelBook Case: A collectable metal case featuring unique artwork;
- Statue of Malenia – Blade of Miquella: A finely detailed 9-inch statue of one of the game’s key characters;
- Exclusive Artbook: A 40-page hardcover artbook that provides a deeper look into the visual design and world-building of Elden Ring;
- Digital Soundtrack: A digital copy of the game's atmospheric and epic music score.

The Elden Ring: Deluxe Edition is a digital special edition of Elden Ring that offers additional content alongside the base game. This edition includes:

- Digital copy of the game: The full game available for download;
- Digital Artbook: A detailed artbook that showcases concept art, character designs, landscapes, and other visual elements from the game, providing insight into the development and artistic direction of Elden Ring;
- Original Soundtrack: A digital version of the game's soundtrack.

The Elden Ring: Launch Edition is a special edition of Elden Ring that was available at the game's release. This edition includes several physical and digital items aimed at enhancing the experience for early adopters. It includes:

- Physical copy of the game;
- Exclusive SteelBook Case: A collectible metal case featuring unique artwork.
- Art Cards: A set of 3 exclusive art cards depicting scenes or characters from the game.
- Woven Patch: A patch featuring a significant symbol from Elden Ring;
- Stickers: A set of stickers with designs related to the game;
- Poster: An exclusive poster showcasing artwork from the game.

Flatland: Prologue is a free, full and original game (not a demo) and also a prequel to Flatland Vol.1.

Run as fast and precise as you can through Flatland, a minimalist neon-style world that is about to change forever. This is a fast-paced hardcore platformer with hand-crafted levels and challenges.

Key features:
- Challenging, fast and fun gameplay;
- Ramping up in difficulty from not-so-easy to soul crushing, Flatland: Prologue features hand-crafted levels with increasing challenges;
- Lightning-fast respawns keep you in the flow even in more difficult levels;
- Controls are simple and accessible but with several layers of depth to master;

The AcceleDrome is an underground racing facility featured in the Hot Wheels universe, where the Teku and Metal Maniacs teams train for the World Race. Located within Dr. Tezla’s headquarters, it combines cave-like architecture with advanced technology. At its center is a holographic "Wheel of Power." Key vehicles associated with the environment include Rat-ified (Metal Maniacs), Chicane (Teku), Spine Buster (Mark Wylde), and Vert Wheeler’s high-performance car.

This DLC includes:
1 Environment to build your tracks: AcceleDrome;
4 Vehicles: Rat-ified, Chicane, Spine Buster, Vert’s;
1 new area to add to the Hot Wheels Creature Rampage mode;
Background, Profile icon, Tag and Card Background.

Lies of P is an action role-playing game set in a dark, Belle Époque-inspired city overrun by deadly puppets. Players control Pinocchio, reimagined as a mechanical warrior, navigating a decaying world while making choices that affect the unfolding narrative. The game features challenging melee combat, weapon customization, and a mechanical arm with various abilities.

The Deluxe Edition includes:
• The base game;
• The Great Venigni’s Signature Coat;
• The Great Venigni’s Glasses;
• Mask worn by those preparing for the festival.

Resident Evil Village: Gold Edition includes the base game with three additional major new features:

- Third Person Mode, which allows the players to play the main story mode from a new perspective;
- The Mercenaries Additional Orders, introducing new playable characters and stages;
- Shadows of Rose, a story DLC continuing the story of Ethan's daughter, Rosemary.

Syberia: The World Before - 20 Years Edition will include;
- Full Game
- A Media Book celebrating 20 years of Syberia

Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 3+4 is a remake of the two skateboarding games originally released in the early 2000s. Players perform tricks, complete objectives, and explore varied skate parks across global locations. The gameplay emphasizes fluid controls, combo chaining, and arcade-style challenges. Each title features a roster of professional skaters, along with customizable characters and gear. The collection preserves the core mechanics of the originals while offering updated visuals and performance on modern platforms.

The Digital Deluxe Edition includes:
- The Doom Slayer and The Revenant playable skaters, each including two secret moves. The Doom Slayer includes 2 unique outfits and the Unmaykr Hoverboard skate deck;
- Additional songs included with the in-game soundtrack;
- Exclusive Doom Slayer, Revenant, and Create-a-Skater skate decks;
- Exclusive themed Create-a-Skater items.
